type: software
title: "AgenticMesh"
authors:
  - family-names: Friedman
    given-names: Daniel Ari
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6232-9096"
repository-code: "https://github.com/docxology/AgenticMesh"
abstract: "Tool-component framework for an Active Inference agentic mesh — an abstract async ToolComponent interface with typed metadata, parameter and return-value dataclasses, plus two worked tools: a sandboxed MathTool and a discrete-POMDP Active Inference agent (A/B/C/D/E matrices, variational free energy, habit learning) with matplotlib diagnostics."
license: MIT
